Description:

The JMAP Mailbox/set property isSeenShared now requires the "a" (admin) right
on the mailbox.  Unlike the other properties set alongside it, isSeenShared
writes an option on the mailbox itself rather than a per-user annotation, so
a sharee holding only lookup and read rights could previously turn shared
seen state on or off for the mailbox's owner.  The equivalent IMAP path
already required write rights.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-4577-j69m-pj53.


